[SIZE="2"][B]Required dependency[/B][/SIZE]
LibAddonMenu-2.0 version 43 or newer is required.

[SIZE="2"][B]AI Disclosure[/B][/SIZE]
Parts of this add-on's codebase and structure were generated with AI assistance. The author (@Tim-P) has personally reviewed and tested the add-on, including the release test suite, and is responsible for its code and maintenance. Please see the included release review document for detailed results.

[COLOR="#87CEEB"]This addon does quite a lot. It can be a bit intimidating, but don't worry - you don't have to do much to use it - most of the features below are in case you want to change the default settings. Feel free to just install it and see what it does![/COLOR]

[SIZE="2"][B]At a glance[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*]Track the items that matter to you.
[*]See your currencies and free backpack and bank space at a glance.
[*]Get alerts for item gains, currency changes, and storage space.
[*]Bank or retrieve your character's crafted items with a keypress.
[*]Top up matching house-chest stacks from your backpack.
[*]Deposit or withdraw one item in a stack, or all but one, with a right-click.
[/LIST]

Out of the box, InventoryCompanion will decide which items and currencies to track, and notify you about. It offers a lot of customization though - you can change almost everything using the game's addon settings and the built in editor.
